h3. Context
* {{src/routes.ts:28}} {{deleteRepo}} The delete route applies no ownership check of its own and relies on {{Store.deleteRepo}}, whose filter lets a non-admin delete system-owned repositories.
* {{src/store.ts:29}} {{Store.deleteRepo}} For a non-admin caller the delete also matches rows whose owner is {{system}}, so any authenticated user can delete shared system repositories.
{panel}

h3. Details
Paths and line numbers refer to commit {{4ef35ce0077924f16ca19a77c0823a644f521bb3}} on main.

